{"schema":"chronicle.reading-stream-units","version":"0.1","snapshot":{"catalog_sha":"81172cbfdba50bb65df5ddb1deafbe23b278af97e0fb9352f99c2b3c0dc31cc4","publication_sequence":1},"query":{"catalog_sha":"81172cbfdba50bb65df5ddb1deafbe23b278af97e0fb9352f99c2b3c0dc31cc4","stream_id":"d3469c4b-97c0-7cb5-b0a5-800c463e5c0e","limit":2,"cursor":null,"direction":null},"page":{"stream_id":"d3469c4b-97c0-7cb5-b0a5-800c463e5c0e","catalog_sha":"81172cbfdba50bb65df5ddb1deafbe23b278af97e0fb9352f99c2b3c0dc31cc4","limit":2,"units":[{"unit_id":"ru_2beddf85efc0d3da1857b147","ordinal":0,"stream_id":"d3469c4b-97c0-7cb5-b0a5-800c463e5c0e","catalog_sha":"81172cbfdba50bb65df5ddb1deafbe23b278af97e0fb9352f99c2b3c0dc31cc4","publication_id":"01a0aa45-b717-7b29-bbae-afd7b72f7fcf","chapter_id":"ch_3ce79a5593e0950c54daa93f","block_id":"t_000001","artifact_sha256":"b75ff39b099bc73e3f31a2ca04a8b3313a3cafa7e12a3c47d81bef8f24ee6c76","text_hash":"6864d2d651fcebbfb95857d87a31207557c71db548edc2c49c31634839ad414e","source_anchor_ids":["anc_06287e3af161b4d4","anc_0dc5d85806a7d265","anc_1d8b0692f7fe3f09","anc_1fd439107ae26a19","anc_2dcb47d55758a839","anc_46baf6caa3454adf","anc_51b4e56fdb0218bf","anc_5719da762139b3b8","anc_63cc7673cff01167","anc_74640a1dbc5c5b67","anc_83ae0e6930c4116a","anc_8aa17d74af2a3232","anc_91da84139c25f0d2","anc_93a679113884c393","anc_a22a294c48cfe917","anc_beb3d69c4846abe4","anc_cd95ee38b5440275","anc_d70503a41579daa2","anc_d953941d9e28efdc","anc_dab589e78274f8a2","anc_f27ceb972e970363","anc_fa833fca8b0ad25e"],"segments":[{"kind":"text","text":"周瑜，字公瑾，是庐江郡舒县人。他的从祖父周景，周景的儿子周忠，都曾担任汉朝太尉。周瑜的父亲周异，任洛阳县令。周瑜长大后身材魁梧，容貌俊美。起初，孙坚带领义军讨伐董卓，把家迁到了舒县。孙坚的儿子孙策与周瑜同岁，两人尤其友好。周瑜把道南的一所大宅让给孙策居住，还到堂上拜见孙策的母亲，两家有无相通，共同享用。周瑜的从父周尚当时任丹杨太守，周瑜前去探望他。正赶上孙策准备渡江向东，到了历阳，便派快马送信告诉周瑜。"},{"kind":"event","span":{"end":288,"text":"周瑜带兵迎接孙策。孙策十分高兴，说：“我得到你，事情就成了。”于是周瑜跟随孙策攻打横江、当利，都攻克了。接着渡江进攻秣陵，击败笮融、薛礼，又转而攻下湖孰、江乘，进军曲阿。","start":203,"status":"resolved","span_id":"es_001","relation":"current","target_ref":"evt_000001","candidate_refs":[],"target_event_id":"01a0aa45-b608-742e-8605-ac42154bb613"},"text":"周瑜带兵迎接孙策。孙策十分高兴，说：“我得到你，事情就成了。”于是周瑜跟随孙策攻打横江、当利，都攻克了。接着渡江进攻秣陵，击败笮融、薛礼，又转而攻下湖孰、江乘，进军曲阿。"},{"kind":"text","text":"刘繇逃走时，孙策的部众已经有几万人了。孙策于是对周瑜说：“凭我们现在的兵力，夺取吴郡、会稽，平定山越，已经足够了。你还是回丹杨镇守吧。”周瑜便回去了。不久，袁术派自己的堂弟袁胤接替周尚担任丹杨太守，周瑜和周尚一同回到寿春。袁术想任用周瑜为将领，周瑜看出袁术最终不会有成就，于是请求担任居巢县长，想借此绕道回到江东，袁术答应了。"},{"kind":"event","span":{"end":471,"text":"周瑜便从居巢回到吴地。这一年是建安三年。","start":451,"status":"resolved","span_id":"es_002","relation":"current","target_ref":"evt_000002","candidate_refs":[],"target_event_id":"01a0aa45-b608-703f-9d7d-9bbd9fd3650b"},"text":"周瑜便从居巢回到吴地。这一年是建安三年。"}],"narrative_time":{"mode":"events","status":"resolved","year_key":"gregorian:198","precision":"year","event_refs":["evt_000001","evt_000002"],"period_key":"gregorian:198:year","year_label":"198年","observations":[{"event_ref":"evt_000002","precision":"year","normalized":{"year":198,"calendar":"proleptic_gregorian","precision":"year","conversion_status":"year_only"},"original_text":"是歲，建安三年也","source_calendar":{"system":"chinese_lunisolar_regnal"}}],"period_label":"（月份未明确）","from_block_id":null,"continues_previous":false},"context_entities":[{"kind":"person","name":"周瑜","entity_ref":"ent_000001","importance":"primary","event_roles":[{"role":"率兵迎接並參戰","event_ref":"evt_000001","participant_index":0},{"role":"返回者","event_ref":"evt_000002","participant_index":0}],"canonical_id":"01a0aa45-b607-71bc-a1e9-99184836d1eb","source_anchor_ids":["anc_06287e3af161b4d4","anc_0dc5d85806a7d265","anc_1d8b0692f7fe3f09","anc_1fd439107ae26a19","anc_2dcb47d55758a839","anc_46baf6caa3454adf","anc_51b4e56fdb0218bf","anc_5719da762139b3b8","anc_63cc7673cff01167","anc_74640a1dbc5c5b67","anc_83ae0e6930c4116a","anc_8aa17d74af2a3232","anc_91da84139c25f0d2","anc_93a679113884c393","anc_a22a294c48cfe917","anc_beb3d69c4846abe4","anc_cd95ee38b5440275","anc_d70503a41579daa2","anc_d953941d9e28efdc","anc_dab589e78274f8a2","anc_f27ceb972e970363","anc_fa833fca8b0ad25e"]},{"kind":"person","name":"孫策",